title Mapping Config Lifecycle (Template -> UI -> JSON)

participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant Processor as SRAProcessor
participant ConfigDir as Workspaces/<view>/mapping_configs
participant MappingUI as MappingConfigManager
participant Engineer

Notebook->Pipeline: refresh_mapping_templates(metadata_df)
Pipeline->Processor: For each bioproject, refresh_template(...)
Processor->ConfigDir: Write <project>.json.template
Pipeline->Notebook: Return project_status_df

Notebook->MappingUI: MappingConfigManager.run()
MappingUI->ConfigDir: Load *.json.template files
MappingUI->ConfigDir: Load existing <project>.json when present
MappingUI->Engineer: Render target-first mapping editor
Engineer->MappingUI: Add target fields and mapping rules
MappingUI->ConfigDir: Save per-project <project>.json configs

Notebook->Pipeline: run_enrichment_stage(...)
Pipeline->ConfigDir: Read project JSON configs
Pipeline->Processor: Apply mappings to project metadata
Pipeline->Notebook: Return enriched metadata + missing configs